{"seq":4,"slug":"offline-state-ux","title":"离线状态用户体验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/offline-data/offline-state-ux","wordCount":1925,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"离线状态用户体验\">离线状态用户体验</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>离线优先不仅仅是技术实现——用户体验同样至关重要。用户在离线时必须明确知道：当前处于离线状态、变更已保存在本地、网络恢复后会自动同步。静默失败（点击&quot;提交&quot;但什么都没发生）会彻底摧毁用户信任。在线状态指示器、乐观 UI、加载与离线的区分、冲突通知、同步状态展示——这些用户体验模式让离线体验优雅而可靠。本节涵盖离线 UX 模式、状态指示器、乐观 UI、冲突体验设计、以及在线检测的微妙之处。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>用户体验</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>在线状态指示器</td>\n<td>始终可见</td>\n<td>顶部横幅或图标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乐观 UI</td>\n<td>用户操作时</td>\n<td>立即反映变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>待同步标记</td>\n<td>操作进入队列</td>\n<td>&quot;保存中…&quot;或图标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成功确认</td>\n<td>同步完成</td>\n<td>&quot;已发送 ✓&quot;轻提示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冲突界面</td>\n<td>同步产生冲突</td>\n<td>差异对比加合并按钮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重试选项</td>\n<td>同步失败</td>\n<td>&quot;点击重试&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一次离线优先操作的状态流转如下——乐观 UI 先落地，网络不可达时进入待同步队列，可达后由后台同步，成功给轻提示、失败给重试入口：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户操作] --&gt; B[乐观 UI 立即更新界面]&#10;    B --&gt; C[写入本地存储并入队]&#10;    C --&gt; D{网络可达?}&#10;    D -- 否 --&gt; E[标记为待同步 pending]&#10;    E --&gt; D&#10;    D -- 是 --&gt; F[后台同步]&#10;    F --&gt; G{同步成功?}&#10;    G -- 是 --&gt; H[标记为已同步 synced 并轻提示确认]&#10;    G -- 否 --&gt; I[标记为失败 failed 显示重试入口]&#10;    I --&gt; F\">graph TD\n    A[用户操作] --&gt; B[乐观 UI 立即更新界面]\n    B --&gt; C[写入本地存储并入队]\n    C --&gt; D{网络可达?}\n    D -- 否 --&gt; E[标记为待同步 pending]\n    E --&gt; D\n    D -- 是 --&gt; F[后台同步]\n    F --&gt; G{同步成功?}\n    G -- 是 --&gt; H[标记为已同步 synced 并轻提示确认]\n    G -- 否 --&gt; I[标记为失败 failed 显示重试入口]\n    I --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"在线检测\">在线检测</h2><p><strong><code>navigator.onLine</code> 属性</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"console.log(navigator.onLine); // true 或 false&#10;&#10;window.addEventListener(&#39;online&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;已恢复在线&#39;);&#10;});&#10;&#10;window.addEventListener(&#39;offline&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;已断开网络&#39;);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>console.log(navigator.onLine); // true 或 false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>window.addEventListener('online', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log('已恢复在线');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>window.addEventListener('offline', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log('已断开网络');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>重要注意事项</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>navigator.onLine === true</code> 并不保证能访问互联网。</li>\n<li>它仅表示&quot;设备有网络连接&quot;。</li>\n<li>用户可能连接了局域网但无法访问外网。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>更可靠的检测方式</strong>：实际请求服务器健康检查端点。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"async function checkOnline() {&#10;  try {&#10;    const res = await fetch(&#39;/api/health&#39;, { method: &#39;HEAD&#39;, cache: &#39;no-store&#39; });&#10;    return res.ok;&#10;  } catch {&#10;    return false;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>async function checkOnline() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const res = await fetch('/api/health', { method: 'HEAD', cache: 'no-store' });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return res.ok;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  } catch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"在线状态指示器\">在线状态指示器</h2><p><strong>顶部横幅或状态图标</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"function OfflineBanner() {&#10;  const [online, setOnline] = useState(navigator.onLine);&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    const handleOnline = () =&gt; setOnline(true);&#10;    const handleOffline = () =&gt; setOnline(false);&#10;    window.addEventListener(&#39;online&#39;, handleOnline);&#10;    window.addEventListener(&#39;offline&#39;, handleOffline);&#10;    return () =&gt; {&#10;      window.removeEventListener(&#39;online&#39;, handleOnline);&#10;      window.removeEventListener(&#39;offline&#39;, handleOffline);&#10;    };&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  if (online) return null;&#10;  return &lt;div className=&quot;banner&quot;&gt;当前处于离线状态，变更已保存在本地。&lt;/div&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function OfflineBanner() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [online, setOnline] = useState(navigator.onLine);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const handleOnline = () => setOnline(true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const handleOffline = () => setOnline(false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    window.addEventListener('online', handleOnline);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    window.addEventListener('offline', handleOffline);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      window.removeEventListener('online', handleOnline);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      window.removeEventListener('offline', handleOffline);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (online) return null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;div className=\"banner\">当前处于离线状态，变更已保存在本地。&#x3C;/div>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>注意</strong>：不要反复弹出&quot;你已离线&quot;的通知，一次横幅提示就够了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"乐观-ui\">乐观 UI</h2><p><strong>立即展示用户操作的结果</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"async function addTask(text) {&#10;  const tempTask = { id: &#39;temp-&#39; + Date.now(), text, status: &#39;pending&#39; };&#10;  setTasks([tempTask, ...tasks]); // 立即更新界面&#10;&#10;  try {&#10;    const real = await fetch(&#39;/api/tasks&#39;, { method: &#39;POST&#39;, body: text }).then((r) =&gt; r.json());&#10;    setTasks((prev) =&gt; prev.map((t) =&gt; (t.id === tempTask.id ? real : t)));&#10;  } catch (err) {&#10;    setTasks((prev) =&gt; prev.map((t) =&gt; (t.id === tempTask.id ? { ...t, status: &#39;failed&#39; } : t)));&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>async function addTask(text) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const tempTask = { id: 'temp-' + Date.now(), text, status: 'pending' };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  setTasks([tempTask, ...tasks]); // 立即更新界面</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const real = await fetch('/api/tasks', { method: 'POST', body: text }).then((r) => r.json());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setTasks((prev) => prev.map((t) => (t.id === tempTask.id ? real : t)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  } catch (err) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setTasks((prev) => prev.map((t) => (t.id === tempTask.id ? { ...t, status: 'failed' } : t)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>效果</strong>：操作感觉瞬间完成，不需要等待网络响应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"待同步标记与保存指示器\">待同步标记与保存指示器</h2><p><strong>显示每条数据的同步状态</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"{&#10;  task.status === &#39;pending&#39; &amp;&amp; &lt;span className=&quot;badge&quot;&gt;保存中…&lt;/span&gt;;&#10;}&#10;{&#10;  task.status === &#39;synced&#39; &amp;&amp; &lt;span className=&quot;badge&quot;&gt;✓&lt;/span&gt;;&#10;}&#10;{&#10;  task.status === &#39;failed&#39; &amp;&amp; &lt;span className=&quot;badge&quot;&gt;⚠️ 重试&lt;/span&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  task.status === 'pending' &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;span className=\"badge\">保存中…&#x3C;/span>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  task.status === 'synced' &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;span className=\"badge\">✓&#x3C;/span>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  task.status === 'failed' &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;span className=\"badge\">⚠️ 重试&#x3C;/span>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>视觉提示</strong>：不仅仅是文字，还应结合图标和颜色。活跃同步时可显示加载动画。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成功确认轻提示\">成功确认轻提示</h2><p><strong>同步成功后通知用户</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"function showToast(message) {&#10;  // 显示提示并自动消失&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 同步成功时&#10;showToast(&#39;已同步 ✓&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function showToast(message) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 显示提示并自动消失</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 同步成功时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>showToast('已同步 ✓');</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>设计原则</strong>：不打断用户操作流程，3-5 秒后自动消失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冲突体验设计\">冲突体验设计</h2><p><strong>内联差异对比</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"function ConflictView({ local, remote }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div className=&quot;conflict&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;h3&gt;检测到冲突&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;      &lt;div className=&quot;diff&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;div className=&quot;local&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;h4&gt;你的版本&lt;/h4&gt;&#10;          {local.text}&#10;        &lt;/div&gt;&#10;        &lt;div className=&quot;remote&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;h4&gt;服务器版本&lt;/h4&gt;&#10;          {remote.text}&#10;        &lt;/div&gt;&#10;      &lt;/div&gt;&#10;      &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; keepLocal()}&gt;保留我的&lt;/button&gt;&#10;      &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; keepRemote()}&gt;使用服务器的&lt;/button&gt;&#10;      &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; merge()}&gt;手动合并&lt;/button&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function ConflictView({ local, remote }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div className=\"conflict\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;h3>检测到冲突&#x3C;/h3></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div className=\"diff\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;div className=\"local\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;h4>你的版本&#x3C;/h4></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          {local.text}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;div className=\"remote\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;h4>服务器版本&#x3C;/h4></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          {remote.text}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;button onClick={() => keepLocal()}>保留我的&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;button onClick={() => keepRemote()}>使用服务器的&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;button onClick={() => merge()}>手动合并&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>适用场景</strong>：文档编辑冲突，不需要立即解决的非紧急冲突。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重试选项\">重试选项</h2><p><strong>同步失败时的界面</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"{&#10;  task.status === &#39;failed&#39; &amp;&amp; &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; retry(task)}&gt;同步失败，点击重试&lt;/button&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  task.status === 'failed' &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;button onClick={() => retry(task)}>同步失败，点击重试&#x3C;/button>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>让用户保有控制权</strong>：自动重试的同时提供手动重试入口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"加载与离线的区分\">加载与离线的区分</h2><p><strong>不要混淆这两种状态</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>加载中：有网络连接，正在获取数据。</li>\n<li>离线：没有网络连接。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>不同的界面反馈</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>加载中：显示加载动画（spinner）。</li>\n<li>离线：显示离线指示器和缓存提示。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>组合展示</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>&quot;正在加载…&quot;（在线但正在获取数据）。</li>\n<li>&quot;当前离线，显示的是缓存数据&quot;（无网络）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"缓存数据标识\">缓存数据标识</h2><p><strong>告知用户数据可能不是最新的</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"{&#10;  isOffline &amp;&amp; &lt;div className=&quot;cached-notice&quot;&gt;显示的是 {formatRelative(cachedAt)} 的缓存数据&lt;/div&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  isOffline &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;div className=\"cached-notice\">显示的是 {formatRelative(cachedAt)} 的缓存数据&#x3C;/div>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>让用户了解数据的新鲜度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"骨架屏与加载动画\">骨架屏与加载动画</h2><p><strong>骨架屏（Skeleton Screen）</strong>：灰色布局占位符，让用户感知加载更快，是现代推荐方案。</p>\n<p><strong>加载动画（Spinner）</strong>：简单直接，适合短暂等待。</p>\n<p><strong>混合使用</strong>：按钮操作用加载动画，内容加载用骨架屏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"空状态处理\">空状态处理</h2><p><strong>离线时的空状态应提供不同文案</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"{&#10;  tasks.length === 0 &amp;&amp;&#10;    (isOffline ? &lt;p&gt;当前处于离线状态。新任务将在重新连接后同步。&lt;/p&gt; : &lt;p&gt;暂无任务，创建一个吧！&lt;/p&gt;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  tasks.length === 0 &#x26;&#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (isOffline ? &#x3C;p>当前处于离线状态。新任务将在重新连接后同步。&#x3C;/p> : &#x3C;p>暂无任务，创建一个吧！&#x3C;/p>);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>根据上下文提供不同的提示信息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"同步状态详情\">同步状态详情</h2><p><strong>为高级用户提供详细信息</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>同步队列大小。</li>\n<li>上次同步时间。</li>\n<li>待同步操作数量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>设置页面</strong>：提供&quot;查看同步日志&quot;和&quot;强制同步&quot;选项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"表单数据持久化\">表单数据持久化</h2><p><strong>长表单内容不因离线或崩溃而丢失</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"function FormWithDraft() {&#10;  const [draft, setDraft] = useState(() =&gt; JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(&#39;draft&#39;) || &#39;{}&#39;));&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    localStorage.setItem(&#39;draft&#39;, JSON.stringify(draft));&#10;  }, [draft]);&#10;&#10;  return &lt;Form value={draft} onChange={setDraft} /&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function FormWithDraft() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [draft, setDraft] = useState(() => JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('draft') || '{}'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    localStorage.setItem('draft', JSON.stringify(draft));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, [draft]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;Form value={draft} onChange={setDraft} />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>效果</strong>：刷新页面或应用崩溃后草稿仍在，给用户安全感。</p>\n<h2 id=\"后台标签页处理\">后台标签页处理</h2><p><strong>标签页不活跃时</strong>：不阻塞同步，Service Worker 仍可在后台工作。</p>\n<p><strong>标签页重新激活时刷新数据</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"document.addEventListener(&#39;visibilitychange&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  if (document.visibilityState === &#39;visible&#39;) {&#10;    // 标签页重新可见时刷新数据&#10;    syncNow();&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (document.visibilityState === 'visible') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 标签页重新可见时刷新数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    syncNow();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"可达性检测\">可达性检测</h2><p><strong>超越 <code>navigator.onLine</code> 的真实检测</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"async function isReachable() {&#10;  try {&#10;    const ctrl = new AbortController();&#10;    setTimeout(() =&gt; ctrl.abort(), 3000); // 3 秒超时&#10;&#10;    const res = await fetch(&#39;/api/ping&#39;, {&#10;      method: &#39;HEAD&#39;,&#10;      signal: ctrl.signal,&#10;      cache: &#39;no-store&#39;,&#10;    });&#10;    return res.ok;&#10;  } catch {&#10;    return false;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>async function isReachable() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const ctrl = new AbortController();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setTimeout(() => ctrl.abort(), 3000); // 3 秒超时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const res = await fetch('/api/ping', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      method: 'HEAD',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      signal: ctrl.signal,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      cache: 'no-store',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return res.ok;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  } catch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>确认服务器真正可达，而非仅仅连接了局域网。</p>\n<h2 id=\"手动离线模式切换\">手动离线模式切换</h2><p><strong>部分应用提供手动离线模式</strong>：用户主动控制是否尝试同步，类似飞行模式。</p>\n<p><strong>适用场景</strong>：高级用户、明确知道自己在无网络环境中工作的情况。</p>\n<h2 id=\"通知体验原则\">通知体验原则</h2><p><strong>避免过度打扰</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>不要每次状态变化都提醒&quot;你离线了&quot;——一次就够。</li>\n<li>不要每个同步操作都弹提示——合并展示。</li>\n<li>横幅不要永远挂着——重连后自动消失。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"测试离线用户体验\">测试离线用户体验</h2><p><strong>测试方法</strong>：使用 DevTools 网络限速切换离线模式、真实飞行模式、慢速 3G 网络。</p>\n<p><strong>验证要点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>离线指示器正确显示。</li>\n<li>操作数据正确保存到本地。</li>\n<li>重连后自动同步。</li>\n<li>用户在各环节都能了解当前状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"无障碍考虑\">无障碍考虑</h2><p><strong>屏幕阅读器状态播报</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"&lt;div role=&quot;status&quot; aria-live=&quot;polite&quot;&gt;&#10;  {isOffline ? &#39;当前处于离线状态&#39; : &#39;在线&#39;}&#10;&lt;/div&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;div role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {isOffline ? '当前处于离线状态' : '在线'}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/div></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>不要仅依赖颜色</strong>：同时使用图标和文字传达状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战案例\">实战案例</h2><p><strong>Twitter PWA</strong>：发推按钮在离线时仍可用，成功后显示&quot;已发送&quot;确认，或持续显示&quot;发送中…&quot;直到网络恢复。</p>\n<p><strong>Notion</strong>：提供细微的离线指示器，所有编辑保存在本地，显示&quot;上次同步于 X 分钟前&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>Slack</strong>：离线时显示横幅提示，消息进入队列，重连后自动发送。</p>\n<h2 id=\"现代设计趋势\">现代设计趋势</h2><p><strong>本地优先思维模式</strong>：不刻意区分在线和离线状态，本地数据始终是来源，同步在后台静默进行。</p>\n<p><strong>&quot;天然可用&quot;体验</strong>：用户无需关心网络状态，应用无论如何都能正常工作。</p>\n<p><strong>代表产品</strong>：Linear、Notion（大部分场景）、Obsidian（默认本地优先）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见反模式\">常见反模式</h2><p><strong>1. 静默失败</strong>：点击&quot;提交&quot;后什么都没发生——用户困惑不解。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 错误的在线指示</strong>：<code>navigator.onLine === true</code> 但服务器实际不可达——给出虚假的在线状态。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 离线时完全阻断操作</strong>：显示&quot;离线无法操作&quot;但不提供任何替代方案。</p>\n<p><strong>4. 离线时丢失数据</strong>：表单内容在离线后消失。</p>\n<p><strong>5. 不区分加载中与离线</strong>：用户无法判断是在等待响应还是没有网络。</p>\n<p><strong>6. 过度通知</strong>：&quot;在线了！离线了！又在线了！&quot;——令人烦躁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><p><strong>1. 始终进行可达性检测</strong>：不仅依赖 <code>navigator.onLine</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 默认使用乐观 UI</strong>：操作结果立即展示。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 显示待同步标记</strong>：让用户了解当前状态。</p>\n<p><strong>4. 持久化表单草稿</strong>：给用户安全感和信心。</p>\n<p><strong>5. 测试真实离线场景</strong>：使用飞行模式和 DevTools 全面测试。</p>\n<p><strong>6. 无障碍播报</strong>：使用 <code>aria-live</code> 通知屏幕阅读器用户。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>离线状态的用户体验与技术实现同等重要——静默失败会摧毁用户信任。在线检测应超越 <code>navigator.onLine</code>，通过实际请求健康检查端点确认可达性。在线状态指示器应克制展示（一次横幅足够），重连后自动消失。乐观 UI 让操作感觉瞬间完成。待同步标记、成功确认、重试选项让用户始终了解数据状态。冲突界面提供差异对比和合并选项。区分加载中与离线状态，展示缓存数据的时效信息。表单草稿持久化防止数据丢失。现代本地优先设计趋势追求&quot;天然可用&quot;——用户无需关心网络状态，应用始终正常工作。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"离线状态用户体验","id":"离线状态用户体验"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"在线检测","id":"在线检测"},{"level":2,"text":"在线状态指示器","id":"在线状态指示器"},{"level":2,"text":"乐观 UI","id":"乐观-ui"},{"level":2,"text":"待同步标记与保存指示器","id":"待同步标记与保存指示器"},{"level":2,"text":"成功确认轻提示","id":"成功确认轻提示"},{"level":2,"text":"冲突体验设计","id":"冲突体验设计"},{"level":2,"text":"重试选项","id":"重试选项"},{"level":2,"text":"加载与离线的区分","id":"加载与离线的区分"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存数据标识","id":"缓存数据标识"},{"level":2,"text":"骨架屏与加载动画","id":"骨架屏与加载动画"},{"level":2,"text":"空状态处理","id":"空状态处理"},{"level":2,"text":"同步状态详情","id":"同步状态详情"},{"level":2,"text":"表单数据持久化","id":"表单数据持久化"},{"level":2,"text":"后台标签页处理","id":"后台标签页处理"},{"level":2,"text":"可达性检测","id":"可达性检测"},{"level":2,"text":"手动离线模式切换","id":"手动离线模式切换"},{"level":2,"text":"通知体验原则","id":"通知体验原则"},{"level":2,"text":"测试离线用户体验","id":"测试离线用户体验"},{"level":2,"text":"无障碍考虑","id":"无障碍考虑"},{"level":2,"text":"实战案例","id":"实战案例"},{"level":2,"text":"现代设计趋势","id":"现代设计趋势"},{"level":2,"text":"常见反模式","id":"常见反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"后台同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/offline-data/background-sync"},"next":{"title":"推送通知","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/capabilities-and-deploy/push-notifications"}}